	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"【2021年春、日本展開開始！！】",
			"• 『三国志』をベースにしたSDガンダムが装いも新たに登場！",
			"• 一新された頭身バランスと各所の関節構造により、躍動感あふれるポージングを再現！",
			"• リバーシブル構造の頭部は、4種類の部隊兵とBUGの計5種から2体を選択再現可能！",
			"• 3エリアのビームフラッグを取扱説明書で再現！",
			"• 組み立て簡単な簡易構造。アクションベース（別売り）対応の他、共通のバックパック取付穴を採用し、カスタマイズも可能に！"
		],
		"en": [
			"[Spring 2021, main rollout begins! ! ]",
			"• SDGundam based on “Romance of the Three Kingdoms” has a new look!",
			"• Reproduce dynamic poses with a completely new head and body balance and joint structure in various places!",
			"• The reversible structure of the head allows you to select and reproduce two out of a total of five types: four types of troops and BUG!",
			"• Beam flags in 3 areas are reproduced in the handling manual!",
			"• Simple structure with easy assembly. In addition to being compatible with the action base (sold separately), it also has common backpack mounting holes, allowing for customization!"
